# Codegen output — regenerated via `npm run generate` from spec/openapi.json.
# Module clients consume this, but it is recreated on every build.
# Note: glob the contents (`/*`) rather than the directory (`/`) so the
# negation below can re-include a single file — git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded.
src/generated/*
# ...except the runtime operation manifest, which is a small, reviewable,
# tracked artifact: the typed-client enforcement surface and the boundary the
# `types:check` drift gate diffs. Regenerated by scripts/generate-operation-index.mjs.
!src/generated/operation-index.ts
docs/api.html
docs/client/
